        "created_at": "2015-07-30T02:00:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Got to play Deck Building and I have to say the Grills are a bit broken. &nbsp; My wife managed to get three grills out every game we played and demolished me with them for most of them. &nbsp;Now I can't convince not to play a game without those promo Grills. &nbsp;</p><p>Anyways, it was still fun to play and I certainly might buy a second copy to play with more people.</p>",
